      "type": "document",
      "name": "chord-remake.md",
      "filePath": "docs/chord-remake.md",
      "summary": "Design brief proposing a rebuild of the note-attack system: map the 7 diatonic chords to QWERTYU with arrow-key chord modifications, add a live chord loop, and record melody notes as chord tones plus tension/color tones.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "design-plan", "chords", "input-mapping"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/combat-pacing-plan.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "combat-pacing-plan.md",
      "filePath": "docs/combat-pacing-plan.md",
      "summary": "Phased redesign plan for combat pacing: engine work (enemy attack cooldowns, intro grace period, enemy and party HP rebalance), rhythm-aware QTE charts derived from melodies and enemy patterns, number-key character selection, and additive suggestions like stagger and dynamic loop length.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "planning", "combat", "pacing", "qte"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/mechanics.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "mechanics.md",
      "filePath": "docs/mechanics.md",
      "summary": "Game design specification for the Polyphonic Active Time Battle system, covering party roles, the four pillars (Harmonic Engine, Melodic Sequencer, Groove Matrix, Cadence Highway), combat math, enemy archetypes, and the three-zone UI screen layout.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "design-spec", "combat", "music-theory", "game-design"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/qte-redesign.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "qte-redesign.md",
      "filePath": "docs/qte-redesign.md",
      "summary": "QTE panel rebuild plan that diagnoses current RAF/state churn jank, surveys FNF/DDR/Guitar Hero conventions, and specifies an always-visible bottom-receptor highway, a single audio-anchored playhead hook, memoized note transforms, and consolidated judgement feedback.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "planning", "qte", "ui", "performance"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/v1-plan.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "v1-plan.md",
      "filePath": "docs/v1-plan.md",
      "summary": "V1 audit that compares the mechanics spec against the actual codebase (matches, mismatches, missing features), criticizes the UI, and lays out a phased roadmap from engine fixes through screen flow, combat UI, missing mechanics, and polish.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "roadmap", "audit", "planning", "game-design"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    }
  ],
